        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mork Folio is a third party companion APP for the ENNIE Award winning Mork Bork RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Random indoor and  outdoor encounter generators provides dozens of encounters for use with your OSR adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Adds dozens of new and original creatures to your Mork Borg adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Browse through Mork Folio to help you plan your next Mork Borg adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Random monster generator allows for fast and exciting content to be generated on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Monsters contain detailed descriptions, stat boxes and pictures to bring your adventure to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* New Oracle system helps solo players craft better adventures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Want some custom atmospheric audio to go with your Mork Borg adventure? Ya thats in Mork Folio too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more wasting time fumbling for random tables or creature sheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mork Folio was designed, built and published by experienced Mork Borg players who know what you need to run a successful adventure.</p>",
